      {
        "trackId": "vt_diversion_post_charge",
        "affectedElement": "governing_mechanism",
        "question": "Source correction recorded rather than carried. The controlling review placed the adult diversion tracks at 3 V.S.A. § 164(g) and (j), split on whether diversion was completed before or after 2002-07-01. Section 164 was read at its official locator on 2026-08-06 and the current scheme is at § 164(f), split on pre-charge versus post-charge rather than on that date. This track carries the post-charge branch at § 164(f)(5), where the court acts. What is not established is whether former § 164(g) or (j) survives anywhere in the current section for a person who completed diversion under the old scheme, which bears on whether an older completion has any route at all."
      },
      {
        "trackId": "vt_diversion_pre_charge",
        "affectedElement": "governing_mechanism",
        "question": "What route, if any, exists for a person who successfully completed adult pre-charge diversion before 2025-07-01. Section 164(f)(4) limits the automatic deletion scheme to completions on or after that date, and whether the former § 164(g) petition route survives for earlier completions was not established from the official text on 2026-08-06. This is the exact population the controlling review assigned to VT-SEAL-11 under the former pre-2002 framing, so the question is squarely on this slot."
      }
    ],
